From 664f923328087da0806636a3da6e0840e570be71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: adesh chaudhari <superbhel7@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 08:28:01 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] feat(frontend): auth context, route guards and shared
 async/format helpers

YG-3, YG-7 and YG-11.

- AuthContext persists { token, userId, name, role } in localStorage and
  registers a callback the API interceptor calls when the server rejects our
  token, so a dead session logs out from outside the React tree.
- ProtectedRoute / AdminRoute: /admin/* was previously reachable by anyone who
  typed the URL. Both remember the intended destination for post-login return.
- useApiData + AsyncBoundary give every page a loading, error and empty state.
  Mock data was instant; a real API is not.
- categories.js is the display map over the backend's four real enum values,
  plus deriveCityOptions() since city is free text, not an enum (plan 4).
- format.js: money and dates are formatted only, never recomputed (plan 2.5).
